WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.701
Learn to state dates of events and record calendar dates in a variety of formats

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:14.881
Write 24 December 2026 as DD/MM/YYYY. The answer is 24/12/2026. Day first, then

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.757
month, then four-digit year.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:26.534
A school fair is on 13/03/2028. What is the date 1 day later? Pause and solve it in

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:27.854
your exercise book.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:35.121
The answer is 14/03/2028. Advance the calendar by one day.
